<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:14.4pt;min-height:48.95pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_hXfM_Af2UkqxPH7g-mlUNA_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_imkrkq_nzkO-_rFawvi3ZQ_1_8"></a><a id="Tc_pJOZkXxzUEa4F5U_cjSlHQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_hiO-zhDdXkSU4JVyGU3VZg_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_8TlAn9IFk0W1LpXwboZtJA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_7HLcGOiTm0-VKQfuoG14Xw_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_Fq9IWBxHrEeeoDWprqH7lQ_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_LAfLxHtytEKwY-KOPOvAuw_3_11"></a><a id="Tc_ilz-KgHQcUKYKCRy6-w5Gw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_AQmD7KFUdkehUOXeLAVmOw_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_qS3PcR-CSUa6xp5sN-VwBw_4_5"></a><a id="Tc_OuW8bt0ZBEqpT0-y-ybJPg_4_8"></a><a id="Tc_hZXIPA2Re0-K3JC8gmvjaQ_4_11"></a><a id="Tc_37KPQBnGWECM5QPuRC1VLw_6_3"></a><a id="Tc_R0vwKUAT6kKRyVoIYHfIGg_6_9"></a><a id="Tc_ndMK0iUBfU6eGl0sx1x9Ug_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_vJbHodCYx0OGcy3MfUPySQ_7_6"></a><a id="Tc_rVo-pxqh7kCp_79ElNYPLQ_7_12"></a><a id="Tc_YTsY9Unax0qwED5hC-WURw_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_7UV_6ygdfkO16FKZjkEsYQ_8_6"></a><a id="Tc_vPz6s4-zw0SFqHxeFxDhqw_8_12"></a><a id="Tc_bRxJ_RZ4RE6v4kGI0MjQKA_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_3IgRCl7MfEaQR5RX1_7axg_9_6"></a><a id="Tc_aBayviSR6EyCDcFdVP7b9w_9_12"></a><a id="Tc_-Pwv28TroES5jDRCXyAf6A_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_QEBDZQ60WUKh4pGtOYnXLw_10_2"></a><a id="Tc_jy-mVj9lXE61D-q0NI1BsA_10_5"></a><a id="Tc_hW6xcrH_QUWi6wWpjzTQtg_10_8"></a><a id="Tc__SN5zu-JUkyqN4jgT_vuLw_10_11"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_-xKFvfPJxE2jJAlS89bHjQ_cont8" continuedAt="Tb_-xKFvfPJxE2jJAlS89bHjQ_cont9"><ix:continuation id="Tb_P7uDj8T64k6lXnfIU3JUMw_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On December 1, 2023, the Company acquired <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_kL8yLbwvTkqQIWD5cJvUxA" contextRef="As_Of_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_tTKkLz-v-k-DiX_MgPlegw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionPercentageOfVotingInterestsAcquired" scale="-2" id="Narr_ctvuDBywokq0Ybye34Sw7w">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the outstanding stock of Scite, Inc. a Delaware corporation (&#8220;Scite&#8221;). The total purchase consideration for Scite, net of cash acquired, was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_RhXwvRKE0EmxZJlrBBPksQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" scale="6" id="Narr_56nDqRr_okOquHE52wX2eQ">21.1</ix:nonFraction> million. The consideration included an initial payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_RhXwvRKE0EmxZJlrBBPksQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesGross" scale="6" id="Narr_0MVNIoLpb0-s6MQ6ehWc4g">7.2</ix:nonFraction> million in cash, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_RhXwvRKE0EmxZJlrBBPksQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" scale="6" id="Narr_UxBtOChux063RHBX9AQfNQ">6.5</ix:nonFraction> million in stock, a holdback of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_RhXwvRKE0EmxZJlrBBPksQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredOther1" scale="6" id="Narr_YCPF-Wrx5kG26W6roPHddg">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million and a contingent earnout that had an initial fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="As_Of_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_tTKkLz-v-k-DiX_MgPlegw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_8WMj-b5QCEGq5IxyCitQZw">7.2</ix:nonFraction> million. The Company&#8217;s contingent earnout liability balance was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_BjfE4bX4ZECIB-Q024MKGQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_y4SXKRyixUSoF3VqPrq8hg">14.0</ix:nonFraction> million at June 30, 2025 and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_HFswAIAsw0ekYMjttV8Dfw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_F7oRqu5XHUygB-dCVRiTlQ">9.0</ix:nonFraction> million at March 31, 2026. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Our contingent earnout liability related to the Scite acquisition is in the &#8220;Level 3&#8221; category for valuation purposes. As of March 31, 2026 and June 30, 2025, the contingent earnout liability fair value was estimated using the ending business to consumer annual recurring revenue figures as of May 30, 2025 and a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_kL8yLbwvTkqQIWD5cJvUxA" contextRef="As_Of_5_30_2025_p6_clEBiukmTaCwnRJYkqg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiabilityMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_1ndlKWL-c0utR94Zg7NWSw">9</ix:nonFraction>% <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_qFzaAQBdz0-HPX18g4RphA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">discount</span></span> rate less payments made. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On July 2, 2025, the Company finalized the calculation of the earnout for former shareholders of Scite at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="As_Of_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_xy4h1poBjEqH6efvd72wDQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_-sAB0Mtmjkubyx2YhrjUwg">15.4</ix:nonFraction> million and recorded the final adjustment as of June 30, 2025. The earnout is comprised of a mix of cash and stock, with <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_kL8yLbwvTkqQIWD5cJvUxA" contextRef="As_Of_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_xy4h1poBjEqH6efvd72wDQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationPercentageOfEarnoutPaidInCash" scale="-2" id="Narr_tTj2tDp_z0aZJDToV8CM5A">62</ix:nonFraction>% of the earnout to be paid in cash and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_kL8yLbwvTkqQIWD5cJvUxA" contextRef="As_Of_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_xy4h1poBjEqH6efvd72wDQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationPercentageOfEarnoutPaidInStock" scale="-2" id="Narr_wJ8zNxf-mke30KoXaBBLUA">38</ix:nonFraction>% in the Company&#8217;s common stock. The first of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_dl1V_2vAZUyx95eDZH6ISg" contextRef="Duration_7_2_2025_To_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_ZAiyZVCkdUyZg9WytHuUjw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="rsss:NumberOfQuarterlyInstallmentPayments" scale="0" id="Narr_t4eqkFzz_UOv0AgKrdB90A">eight</ix:nonFraction> quarterly installment payments was disbursed in August 2025, with subsequent payments scheduled to continue quarterly until the final payment in May 2027. After June 30, 2025, the Company records accreted interest expense. Prior to June 30, 2025, the change in fair value was based on the assistance of a valuation specialist, using a Monte Carlo simulation of discounted cash flows based on management's forecast.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The following table summarizes the Company&#8217;s contingent earnout liability activity:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_D6xrTpHXekiDSn6pI4Ad2w" name="us-gaap:FairValueLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringBasisUnobservableInputReconciliationTextBlock" id="Tb_dSYgTfaqG0uzA_5_zSC2PQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:46.01%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.06%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow