ount will be amortized over the vesting period. The total stock options expense during the nine months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_Ez0au2XfcUqXJhlZSYHYHg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_s1BUS00SqE2J64O33vAg0Q">239,818</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_4Mp892m1U0C-Z1e7uVy-Aw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_sgW0qzyj_EGmzYdZ4WklgQ">146,751</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, and is included in selling, general and administrative expenses in the accompanying condensed consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive income (loss). As of March 31, 2026, the amount of unvested compensation related to the unvested options was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_j3-wDMno4kOi7HDmMoBqbg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" scale="0" id="Narr_LYXC11Ht9kStlZLz51Ssyg">557,245</ix:nonFraction> which will be recorded as an expense in future weighted average vesting periods of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_Birs3f5zrkyyeqTZZ7vUtA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">1.11</span></span> years. During the nine months ended March 31, 2026, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_mRR5HeLypE-4AKGrZbYxYA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_y34cUEyigE66fYStihMFjw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_SnrtKhVDjk-7wYSs-5ly2A">245,469</ix:nonFraction> net shares of common stock upon the exercise of options underlying <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_mRR5HeLypE-4AKGrZbYxYA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_D6xrTpHXekiDSn6pI4Ad2w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_-QCYHAzMGk25b595Q_dY4A">268,500</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, resulting in net cash proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_D6xrTpHXekiDSn6pI4Ad2w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_2YJD_ibzcEyoqqP9tarkHQ">157,500</ix:nonFraction>. The aggregate intrinsic value of options exercised during the nine months ended March 31, 2026 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_D6xrTpHXekiDSn6pI4Ad2w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisesInPeriodTotalIntrinsicValue" scale="0" id="Narr_eB7TeUEu90WsH-rh6fa7hw">562,170</ix:nonFraction>. During the nine months ended March 31, 2025, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_mRR5HeLypE-4AKGrZbYxYA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_3A1QvputZUCLejECYK5ftg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_CxA-J4GGZ0-PGdhVGrgx8Q">48,927</ix:nonFraction> net shares of common stock upon the exercise of options underlying <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_mRR5HeLypE-4AKGrZbYxYA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_3_31_2025_5khiMuoAo0ifcwWBfvHo-Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr__rCHy4dTckSrVQm8tpd8zA">128,821</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock. The aggregate intrinsic value of options exercised during the nine months ended March 31, 2025 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sDrcF0UkMEyY00iiBtlkcA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_3_31_2025_5khiMuoAo0ifcwWBfvHo-Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisesInPeriodTotalIntrinsicValue" scale="0" id="Narr_X-1Ca4FawU6WNxIV4PNNvg">156,712</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The following table presents the assumptions used to estimate the fair values based upon a Black-Scholes option pricing model of the stock options granted during the nine&#160;months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025. </p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_D6xrTpHXekiDSn6pI4Ad2w" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedPaymentAwardStockOptionsValuationAssumptionsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_QiIujMl72kurtgRUuv1lfQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:84.99%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:66.54%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</